        <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="893f-9000-ccf7-648e">Anti-Infantry 5+, Blast 2, Devastating Wounds, Torrent</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Enigmatus Exhaust Projector" id="3959-4580-4256-9eab" hidden="false" typeId="a8b2-cae8-0cb2-0c83" typeName="Equipment">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Models in this unit have Stealth. When models in this unit arrive on the battlefield using Deep Strike, models in this unit have a 4+ Feel No Pain until the start of the player’s next turn.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Grenade Harness (Preceptor)" id="bafe-709c-ac05-f380" hidden="false" typeId="a8b2-cae8-0cb2-0c83" typeName="Equipment">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Has the Explosives Keyword</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Order Exemplars" id="5786-f934-f65b-117d" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">When a Unit that includes any Models with this Special Rule is selected as part of a Detachment, during Army selection, a single option from the Orders of the Hekatonystika presented below must selected for all Models in that Unit.


Augurs of Weakness – Melee Weapons gain Anti-Vehicle 4+
Icons of Resolve – Add +1 to Leadership and Objective Control
Slayers of Kings – Melee Weapons gain Precision
Hunters of Beasts – Melee Weapons add 1 to AP and Damage while targeting Monsters.
Reaper of Hosts – Melee Weapons score critical hits on a 5+ when targeting Infantry Units
Breakers of Witches – Attacks made by models in this unit have Anti-Psyker 4+</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Rapid Advance" id="99a3-fb80-59fa-ae9a" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">While this unit contains a Ravenwing Strikemaster, each time an enemy unit targets this unit with a ranged attack, if this unit has made a Normal Move or Advanced this turn, subtract 1 from the Hit roll.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Power Overload" id="2e4e-7800-b248-0841" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">Each time this model makes an attack that targets a MONSTER or VEHICLE unit, you can re-roll the Damage roll.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Beyond the Hexagrammon" id="57d7-1c48-59c0-ea42" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">Models in this unit do not have a Hexagrammon unit type. Models in this unit are counted as every Hexagrammon unit type for the purpose of attaching units, stratagems, army rules, etc.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Attached Unit" id="de60-0c4d-d71f-4e90" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <comment>Hand of the Lion</comment>
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">If a Character unit from your army with the Leader or Support abilities has the Chapter Master Keyword, it can be attached to this unit.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Coherent Unit" id="3b99-565d-0882-56ee" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">Dreadnought models in this unit may join the rest of the unit in a Transport, so long as the transport has enough transport capacity. Each Shieldbearer model has the Bulky (7) ability,.


When an attack targets this unit, the Defender must declare that the Shieldbearers of the Lion are the first group to have attacks allocated to them. While any Shieldbearers of the Lion models are part of this unit, models in this unit have a Toughness of 9 and cannot be targeted by Precision.
• If this unit is targeted by an attack with Precision, that attack may be resolved against a character even if Shieldbearers of the Lion were part of this unit during the same resolution of attacks, provided that all Shieldbearers of the Lion that were a part of this unit were destroyed</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Elite Warriors" id="a479-0c8a-7e48-8372" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">At the start of the player’s turn, select one of the following benefits to be active until the start of the player’s next turn:
• Ranged Weapons equipped by models in this unit have the Assault keyword.
• Models roll 3d6 for the charge roll, dropping one die of their choice.
• Models in this unit can Shoot and Declare a Charge in a turn in which it started to perform an Action</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Legendary Status" id="b796-adfe-6d0d-04f2" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">Only one Hand of the Lion unit may be included in an army.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Personal Transport" id="9bdd-d6f7-58de-dbe6" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">Once per game, at the end of your opponent’s turn, if this unit is not in engagement ranged of any enemy models, you can remove this unit from the battlefield and place it into Strategic Reserves.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Beastshield" id="b2d0-dda6-c043-6187" hidden="false" typeId="a8b2-cae8-0cb2-0c83" typeName="Equipment">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When an attack is allocated to a model with this special rule, roll 1d6. On a 5+ ignore all damage from that attack.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Relic Storm Shield" id="1dfa-7388-2bad-80c9" hidden="false" typeId="a8b2-cae8-0cb2-0c83" typeName="Equipment">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">3+ Invulnerable Save</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
